<title>FRANCE: EU raises daily malt export refund.</title>
<headline>EU raises daily malt export refund.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday raised the daily refund applying to unroasted malt exports to 37.70 Ecus per tonne from a previous level of 15.00 Ecus per tonne, member-country officials said.</p>
<p>The EU grain panel also raised the refund applying to wheat malt exports to 17.00 Ecus per tonne from eight Ecus per tonne. --Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
